  e2e: { waived: "W21 changes what the setup screen draws under a line, which the integration layer holds in the rendered screen; the e2e drives no note. cargo xtask ui e2e ran 47 of 48: the one failure, onboarding.spec.ts 'the device chosen opens its first guide', fails identically with W21's code stashed, because it expects an emulator running on the host and none was (roadmap row). The walkthrough's chapters now open notes through the switch; it is re-filmed at the epic close." }
